OL,3,GNEWSA'We have no interest in hearing
OL,4,Afrom Huw Edwards', Downing Street says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister's spokesperson has
OL,7,Fsaid broadcasters must "act
OL,8,Fresponsibly" and that "we have no
OL,9,Finterest in hearing" what Huw Edwards
OL,10,Fhas to say, following a backlash
OL,11,Fagainst new interviews with the
OL,12,Fdisgraced former BBC News presenter.
OL,14,FEdwards, who was convicted in 2024 for
OL,15,Fmaking indecent images of children, has
OL,16,Fbeen interviewed for a Channel 4
OL,17,Fdocumentary plus a podcast by the
OL,18,FObserver and Tortoise Media.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
